{
  "title": "Bunge \u2014 AIOps: ServiceNow Auto-Remediation [dd-demo-toolkit:agribusiness]",
  "description": "Eduardo's #1 ask, live: Watchdog detects, a Datadog Workflow enriches and auto-opens a ServiceNow incident, then auto-closes it on recovery \u2014 analysts see one real incident, not an alert storm. SIMULATED close-loop (no live ServiceNow integration in this env): the agri.itsm.* signals are driven by the data-platform cascade in lockstep with the incident. [dd-demo-toolkit:agribusiness]",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "# AIOps \u2014 ServiceNow Auto-Remediation (close-loop)\n\n**Enrich \u2192 auto-open \u2192 auto-close**, human-in-the-loop where you want control. This is the loop Eduardo asked for. *Simulated here \u2014 no live ServiceNow integration in this env; the counts below are driven in lockstep with the data-platform cascade.*",
        "background_color": "vivid_blue",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Incidents Auto-Opened",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_auto_opened{*}",
                "aggregator": "last"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Incidents Auto-Closed",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_auto_closed{*}",
                "aggregator": "last"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 2,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Open Incidents Now",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_open{*}",
                "aggregator": "last"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 1,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 1,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "MTTR (min) \u2014 automated",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "avg:agri.itsm.mttr_minutes{*}",
                "aggregator": "avg"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 30,
                "palette": "white_on_red"
              },
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 15,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<=",
                "value": 15,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "min",
        "precision": 1
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Noise Reduction %",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "avg:agri.itsm.noise_reduction_pct{*}",
                "aggregator": "avg"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 85,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 85,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "%",
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Auto-Close Rate %",
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "q"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "avg:agri.itsm.auto_close_rate_pct{*}",
                "aggregator": "avg"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">=",
                "value": 80,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 80,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "custom_unit": "%",
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 10,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## The loop, live\nAn incident auto-opens the moment the customer-facing symptom appears and auto-closes when the feed and quotes recover. The alert storm collapses into one correlated incident.",
        "background_color": "vivid_orange",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Open ServiceNow incidents (auto-opened \u2192 auto-closed pulse)",
        "show_legend": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_open{*}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "area"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Alert noise collapsed into one incident (raw signals suppressed)",
        "show_legend": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "q",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.alerts_suppressed{*}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "bars"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Cumulative auto-opened vs auto-closed (the close-loop balances)",
        "show_legend": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "opened",
                "alias": "auto-opened"
              },
              {
                "formula": "closed",
                "alias": "auto-closed"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "opened",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_auto_opened{*}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "closed",
                "query": "max:agri.itsm.incidents_auto_closed{*}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Why it opened \u2014 CME feed age (s) drives the auto-incident",
        "show_legend": true,
        "requests": [
          {
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "feed",
                "alias": "CME feed age (s)"
              },
              {
                "formula": "stale",
                "alias": "FRM stale-quote %"
              }
            ],
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "feed",
                "query": "avg:agri.dataplatform.pricing_feed_age_sec{$environment,$region,$business_segment}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "stale",
                "query": "avg:agri.pricing.stale_quote_pct{$environment,$region,$business_segment}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 20",
            "display_type": "error dashed",
            "label": "Feed stale > 20s"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## Simulated enriched ServiceNow ticket\n*(what the Workflow auto-creates \u2014 illustrative payload; bind a ServiceNow connection to make it live)*\n\n```\nINC1000001  \u00b7  Urgency: 1 - High  \u00b7  Assignment group: data-platform-sre\nShort description: Stale CME pricing feed degrading revenue apps (auto-detected)\nState: In Progress \u2192 Resolved (auto)\n\n\u2014 Auto-enrichment (Datadog Workflow) \u2014\nRoot cause : CME market-data feed staleness on the GCP Bunge Data Platform\nSignal     : agri.dataplatform.pricing_feed_age_sec  (Watchdog, no threshold set)\nBlast radius: Bunge Mobile, myBunge, BungeServices, FRM, BungeAg (5 revenue apps)\nCustomer   : FRM stale-quote % elevated; farmers quoted on stale prices\nRunbook    : restart Dataflow/Composer pricing-feed job \u2192 verify feed age < 20s\nClose note : feed age < 20s and stale-quote < 1% sustained \u00b7 MTTR ~12m vs ~59m manual\n```",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "12",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "region",
      "prefix": "region",
      "default": "*",
      "available_values": [
        "south-america",
        "north-america",
        "emea",
        "apac"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "environment",
      "prefix": "environment",
      "default": "production",
      "available_values": [
        "production",
        "staging",
        "dr-site"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "business_segment",
      "prefix": "business_segment",
      "default": "*",
      "available_values": [
        "agribusiness",
        "refined-specialty-oils",
        "milling"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
